---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CookieBanner from '../components/CookieBanner.astro';
---
<Layout 
  title="121mcv | Independent UK Commercial Market Entry Advisory"
  description="Independent UK Commercial Market Entry Advisory helping European industrial technology companies validate opportunities and develop lower-risk expansion strategies."
>
  <div class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
    
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-border/70 bg-background/85 backdrop-blur-md">
      <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-4 lg:px-8">
        <a href="#top" class="flex flex-col leading-none">
          <span class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">121mcv</span>
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-[0.6875rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">UK Commercial Entry Assessment™</span>
        </a>
        <ul class="hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex">
          <li><a href="#assessment" class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary">Assessment</a></li>
          <li><a href="#experience" class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary">Experience</a></li>
          <!-- The Contact link has been removed from here -->
        </ul>
        <!-- Calendly link added to the top right button -->
        <a href="https://calendly.com/121mcv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hidden rounded-sm border border-primary/20 bg-primary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 sm:inline-block">Request a discussion</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content" class="flex-1">
      
      <!-- HERO SECTION -->
      <section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 pb-20 pt-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-16 lg:px-8 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-24">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="h-px w-8 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">Independent UK Commercial Market Entry Advisory</p>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-balance font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-primary md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.5rem]">UK Market Entry for European Industrial Technology Companies</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold tracking-wide text-accent uppercase">Commercial Strategy | Business Development</p>
            <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">I help European industrial technology companies evaluate, validate and execute successful UK market entry strategies.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The UK Commercial Entry Assessment™ provides an independent evaluation of market opportunity, commercial viability, route-to-market options and practical recommendations before significant expansion investment is made.</p>
            <div class="mt-8">
              <!-- Calendly link added to the main hero button too -->
              <a href="https://calendly.com/121mcv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-primary px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">Request an Initial Market Entry Discussion<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-border">
              <img src="/hero-industrial.png" alt="Modern industrial technology facility exterior in muted editorial tones" class="h-full w-full object-cover">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/25 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-5 hidden max-w-[15rem] rounded-sm border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm lg:block">
              <p class="font-serif text-sm leading-snug text-primary">“Validate the opportunity before you invest.”</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Commercial Assessment Framework / 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- STATS BAR -->
      <section class="border-b border-border bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-px px-6 py-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8">
          <div class="px-2 py-8 sm:px-6">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent md:text-4xl">25+ Years</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">International B2B commercial experience</p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-2 py-8 sm:px-6">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent md:text-4xl">£500M+</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Commercial frameworks, supply opportunities and enterprise engagements supported</p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-2 py-8 sm:px-6">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-accent md:text-4xl">UK • Europe</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Industrial &amp; technical markets</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- THE COMMERCIAL PROBLEM -->
      <section id="problem" class="border-b border-border">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8">
          <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-balance text-center font-serif text-xl leading-relaxed text-primary md:text-2xl">Designed for European industrial technology companies with proven solutions seeking objective evidence before committing UK expansion resources.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-border bg-secondary/40">
          <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16 lg:px-8">
            <div>
              <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">The Commercial Problem</p>
              <h2 class="text-balance font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-primary md:text-4xl">Entering the UK market involves more risk than simply finding customers.</h2>
              <p class="mt-6 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Many European industrial technology companies operate with functional products, strong engineering capabilities and proven domestic customers. The challenge begins when expanding internationally. Evaluation of key commercial parameters remains a critical dependency:</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <ul class="divide-y divide-border border-y border-border">
                <li class="flex gap-4 py-5"><span class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-accent">01</span><p class="leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Identification of the specific UK industries representing the strongest operational opportunity.</p></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4 py-5"><span class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-accent">02</span><p class="leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Isolation of appropriate target customers and local decision makers.</p></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4 py-5"><span class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-accent">03</span><p class="leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Determination of the entry architecture: direct sales model, distribution networks, or strategic partnerships.</p></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4 py-5"><span class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-accent">04</span><p class="leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Verification of market readiness and infrastructure compatibility for the specific technical solution.</p></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4 py-5"><span class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-accent">05</span><p class="leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Quantification of the exact financial and human resource investment required.</p></li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card px-5 py-4 text-pretty leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">Unverified market entry decisions frequently result in wasted investment, unsuitable partnerships, delayed market timelines and missed commercial opportunities.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- THE ASSESSMENT -->
      <section id="assessment" class="border-b border-border">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
          <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">A Structured Approach</p>
            <h2 class="text-balance font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-primary md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">The UK Commercial Entry Assessment™</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 font-serif text-xl italic text-muted-foreground">Validate the opportunity before you invest.</p>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">A structured commercial assessment provides business leaders with an objective framework to evaluate the UK opportunity before committing time, local resources or corporate capital.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-card p-7">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Stage 1</span></div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">UK Market Entry Strategy</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Definition of the core strategic architecture to approach UK commercial entry. Evaluation parameters include:</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-border pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Core corporate market positioning alignment</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Target client profile and primary positioning mechanics</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Resource and direct support scalability frameworks</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-card p-7">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Stage 2</span></div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Route-to-Market Development</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Definition of the lowest-risk architecture to scale local commercial traction. Evaluation parameters include:</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-border pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Direct sales model integration requirements</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Distribution strategy and tier-two ecosystem alignment</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Strategic industry partnership networks</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-card p-7">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Stage 3</span></div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Market Opportunity Assessment</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Analysis isolates precisely where the strongest structural UK opportunities exist. Evaluation parameters include:</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-border pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>High-priority vertical industry identification</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Macroeconomic conditions and regional market drivers</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local customer technical and operational specifications</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Competitive environment mapping</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-card p-7">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Stage 4</span></div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Partner &amp; Distributor Development</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Mitigation of channel assumptions through direct validation of market landscape paths. Evaluation parameters include:</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-border pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Channel partner capability validation tracks</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local distribution channel criteria mapping</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Strategic alliance vetting and initial commercial parameters</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-card p-7">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Stage 5</span></div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Executive Stakeholder Engagement</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Analysis determines whether internal business infrastructure is prepared for UK client requirements. Evaluation parameters include:</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-border pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Product maturity and localized regulatory compliance</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Post-sale customer and engineering support readiness</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Key executive decision maker connection mapping</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col bg-card p-7">
              <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Stage 6</span></div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Target Account Identification</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Overall market opportunity translates into precise commercial pipeline generation. Evaluation parameters include:</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 border-t border-border pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>High-priority target accounts generation</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Key decision makers and internal procurement paths</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-snug text-foreground/85"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Immediate addressable commercial pipeline opportunities</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-16 rounded-sm bg-primary p-8 text-primary-foreground md:p-12">
            <div class="max-w-2xl">
              <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl">What You Receive</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">The assessment concludes with a structured commercial market entry report containing:</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 bg-primary-foreground/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium">UK Market Entry Strategy</div>
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 bg-primary-foreground/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium">Route-to-Market Recommendation</div>
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 bg-primary-foreground/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium">UK Market Opportunity Report</div>
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 bg-primary-foreground/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium">Partner &amp; Distributor Evaluation</div>
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 bg-primary-foreground/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium">Executive Stakeholder Mapping</div>
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 bg-primary-foreground/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium">Target Account Map</div>
              <div class="rounded-sm border border-accent/60 bg-accent px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3">90-Day Actionable Commercial Roadmap</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- EXECUTION BRIDGE & WHY CONSULTANCY -->
      <section class="border-b border-border bg-secondary/40">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:px-8">
          <div id="execution-bridge">
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">From Assessment to Execution</p>
            <h2 class="text-balance font-serif text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-primary md:text-3xl">From Assessment to Local Execution</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">The UK Commercial Entry Assessment™ provides the operational baseline for market entry. Upon completion of the validation phase and definition of the clear route-to-revenue, options exist to retain an ongoing UK Commercial Partner function.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">This allows execution of targeted business development campaigns, engagement of enterprise stakeholders, and management of fractional UK commercial functions without the immediate overhead, local compliance friction, or structural risk of recruiting an in-house regional team.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="why-consultancy" class="lg:border-l lg:border-border lg:pl-16">
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Why 121mcv</p>
            <h2 class="text-balance font-serif text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-primary md:text-3xl">Commercial strategy meets practical execution</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">Unlike traditional market research firms or sales agencies, 121mcv combines commercial strategy with practical business development experience.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Operational background includes supporting market development, commercial engagement and complex B2B sales across industrial technology, telecommunications, manufacturing, engineering and international supply chains. This operational experience informs the methodology applied within each UK Commercial Entry Assessment™.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
      <section id="experience" class="border-b border-border">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
          <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Relevant Commercial Experience</p>
            <h2 class="text-balance font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-primary md:text-4xl">Verified operational exposure to complex commercial markets</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Market evaluation requires verified operational exposure to the mechanisms governing how complex technology moves from technical solution to validated commercial opportunity.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 italic">Experience includes supporting international commercial initiatives across industrial automation, enterprise infrastructure, manufacturing, telecommunications and global supply chains, including projects involving organisations such as Vestas, Tarmac, Hanson and Freshfields Bruckhaus Deringer.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
            <article class="flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-border bg-card p-7">
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Industrial IoT &amp; Predictive Maintenance</h3>
              <div class="mt-5 flex-1 space-y-5">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">The Challenge</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Introduction of a European industrial technology solution possessing zero established UK market presence. The technology addressed plant-level asset downtime minimization, telemetry integration, and predictive maintenance optimization.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Operational Role</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Directed targeted market identification and local communication structures. Handled foundational infrastructure mapping and introduced technical capabilities to major enterprise industrial procurement operations.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-secondary/50 px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"><span class="font-semibold text-primary">Outcome: </span>Established verified procurement access into tier-one industrial clients — including Tarmac and Hanson — resulting in structural placement inside localized installation frameworks.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-border bg-card p-7">
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">International Industrial Supply — Renewables</h3>
              <div class="mt-5 flex-1 space-y-5">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">The Challenge</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Commercial development optimization for heavy-gauge engineering components requiring alignment with high-barrier European manufacturing frameworks.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Operational Role</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Served as technical and commercial relationship liaison for POSCO manufacturing output based in South Korea, managing end-to-end RFI requirements and competitive procurement mechanics for destination infrastructure operations.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-secondary/50 px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"><span class="font-semibold text-primary">Outcome: </span>Secured formal placement inside a $500 million steel supply framework, capturing approximately 30% of the allocated European wind-power manufacturing requirement with Vestas (Denmark).</p>
            </article>
            <article class="flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-border bg-card p-7">
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Enterprise Infrastructure Systems</h3>
              <div class="mt-5 flex-1 space-y-5">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">The Challenge</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Migration management for an international professional services firm transitioning legacy corporate network architecture into highly available, multi-site global communications infrastructure.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Operational Role</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Managed internal deployment case design, stakeholder justification parameters, and executive review matrices for enterprise architecture running across high-performance network backbones.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-secondary/50 px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"><span class="font-semibold text-primary">Outcome: </span>Finalized corporate contract terms to successfully close a £200,000 infrastructure agreement with leading global law firm Freshfields Bruckhaus Deringer.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-border bg-card p-7">
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary">Commercial Translation Capability</h3>
              <div class="mt-5 flex-1 space-y-5">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Industrial Domain Breadth</h4>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">Operational experience spans technical domains including industrial automation systems, enterprise telemetry, digital network protocols, industrial-grade computing solutions, and plant-level digital transformation architectures.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
